Hello all *waves*,

I was wondering if there are any kind Nethackers who wouldn't mind
offering me some advice, but not really spoilers.

Shameful History:

I've been playing Nethack on and off for over 10 years and to my shame,
I've never ascended. Not even close.  (I'm always a Valk). Until last
year, I'd only ever started on the quest once and soon died to a wand of
death! But after speaking to some kind souls on NAO, I was advised to slow
down, not read un-id'd scrolls, get reflection and magic resistance etc.
This has really really helped. Thank you all. I love you all. You've
taught me to respect and love Nethack more than I did already.

My best game ever prior to my current game, was actually on NAO in which I
discovered more amazing things than I thought possible. I did the quest in
this game and killed Medusa and Jubliex but died in the maze of hell
(ghenom? - is this spelt right?) due to an encounter with some green
slime. Never saw that before either, but I've learnt to stay away from
slime now :)

Anyhow, a quick game locally one night before bed spiraled into a massive
