failure rate whenever I wanted (magic power permitting) felt like I was
cheating!

However this was soon reconcilled because I'm not cheating and I should
just damned well enjoy it :)

My bag of holding contains a few spellbooks, some gold, some potions to be
made into holy water, some gems, backup unicorn horn and Mjollnir.

