All altars that I've found so far I have converted to Odin. Well, except
those with a priest.  Should I try to convert these or is it bad?  I think
I can take the priest but when I've killed a priest of a different
alignment in the past, I'm sure bad things have happened.

Anyhow, so onto my main question I guess:

I know that next I'll meet Jubliex at some point but then after that, all
I know is that there are loads of mazes ahead.  I've overheard enough talk
on #nethack to know that there are a whole bunch of things coming up
involving a book, a vibrating square and so on - and I'm wondering, Does
Nethack tell you what to do at some point.  i.e. will Odin tell me that
apart from finding the amulet, I need to kill X and take amulet to Y ?
Will I find a scroll or something to tell me?  I really don't want to be
spoilered with a walkthrough now, but similarly I'm worried that I'll mess
up my game next by floundering around trying to figure out what I need to
do.

I appreciate that I have a whole bunch of killing to do ahead before the
end is reached; just wondering if it's something you have to figure out by
